dot-rm(1) -- Remove (unlink) dotfiles from repo to home directory
=================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`dot rm` [-h] <file>...

## DESCRIPTION

Remove (unlink) dotfiles from the dotfile repository. The actual source file is not removed.

Part of dot(1).

## OPTIONS

  * `-h`, `--h`:
    Show command help.

  * <file>:
    One or more managed files. Paths are relative to the dotfile repo.
